# Forever Party Rentals — HTTP response headers
# Works on Netlify and Cloudflare Pages (identical syntax).
# If you deploy elsewhere (Vercel, S3/CloudFront, GitHub Pages), replicate
# these in that host's header-config equivalent, or rely on the in-HTML
# <link> fallbacks declared in each page's <head>.

# ── Long-cache static assets ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Images live at stable filenames (we add new size variants with new names
# like -1200w.webp; we don't re-encode in place). shared.css/shared.js are
# cache-busted via ?v=N in the HTML, so the URL changes when the file does.
# 1y + immutable means browsers serve from cache without revalidating.
/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/shared.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/shared.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/favicon.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

# Homepage — advertise discovery endpoints per RFC 8288 (Web Linking).
# Rels used here are registered with IANA:
#   sitemap         — https://www.iana.org/assignments/link-relations
#   privacy-policy  — https://www.iana.org/assignments/link-relations
#   contact         — https://www.iana.org/assignments/link-relations
/
  Link: </sitemap.xml>; rel="sitemap"
  Link: </privacy>; rel="privacy-policy"
  Link: </contact>; rel="contact"
  Link: </.well-known/agent-skills/index.json>; rel="https://agentskills.io/rel/index"; type="application/json"

# Same on every HTML page so crawlers hitting deep links still find them.
# Plus baseline security headers applied site-wide.
#
# CSP allowlist explained:
#   script-src       — self + Adelie booking SDK + jsDelivr (Bootstrap, datepicker) +
#                      Google Tag Manager / GA4 / Google Ads conversion tags
#                      (GTM container GTM-KC35GGRQ in template <head>).
#                      'unsafe-inline' is required by inline <script>window.orgId = …</script>
#                      blocks and the FAQ/contact-form/share-button hydration in shared.js.
#   style-src        — self + Google Fonts CSS + jsDelivr (Bootstrap, datepicker).
#                      'unsafe-inline' covers per-page <style> blocks.
#   img-src          — self + data: + https: (Squarespace CDN images are scattered widely;
#                      blanket https: also covers GA4/Ads pixel beacons).
#   font-src         — self + Google Fonts files.
#   connect-src      — self + https: (Adelie posts to its own backend; blanket https: also
#                      covers GA4 collect endpoints — tighten if/when known).
#   frame-src        — self + GTM noscript iframe + DoubleClick (Ads remarketing iframes
#                      injected by gtm.js).
#   frame-ancestors  — 'self' (clickjacking defense, parallel to X-Frame-Options).
/*
  Link: </sitemap.xml>; rel="sitemap"
  Link: </privacy>; rel="privacy-policy"
  Link: </contact>; rel="contact"
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=(self), interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://embed-scripts-production.web.app https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://www.googleadservices.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://www.google.com https://www.google.ca; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https:; frame-src 'self' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://td.doubleclick.net https://bid.g.doubleclick.net; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' mailto:; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests

# ── Embeddable Event Layout Planner ─────────────────────────────────────────
# This single path is the only surface that other sites can iframe. Headers
# are relaxed *only here* — the rest of the site keeps frame-ancestors 'self'.
# The iframe loads its own JS bundle from the same origin (planner/planner.js),
# so script-src 'self' is sufficient. data: URLs are needed for the SVG-to-PNG
# export pipeline (we serialize an SVG and rasterize it via an Image element).
#
# Path matches the clean canonical (Netlify pretty_urls=true rewrites
# /event-layout-planner-embed.html → /event-layout-planner-embed at the edge
# before applying headers).
/event-layout-planner-embed
  X-Frame-Options: ALLOWALL
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https:; frame-ancestors *; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' mailto:; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
